  "description": "Camera acquisition contract and tame frame sources for the CvInspect machine-vision toolkit — an ICam abstraction with factory registration, a virtual camera (test pattern / image-folder replay), and a VideoCapture-backed source (webcam, video file, RTSP). Frames are OpenCvSharp Mat; heavy vendor/GigE backends plug in as separate adapter packages.",
